# agent-data/ — reference data index

Permanent assets {{name}} reads at runtime: catalogs, templates, specifications,
images. Committed; never user uploads (those go in `inputs/`) and never run results
(those go in `outputs/`). **Every asset is listed here** — an unlisted file is
invisible to the agent.

| Path | Purpose | Used by |
|---|---|---|
| _(none yet)_ | | |

Scripts reference assets relative to the repo root (`ROOT / "agent-data" / ...`),
never by absolute path.
